Modified files in src/ (changes by Nilotpal Chakraborty, 2023):
  riemann_solver.cpp          - added AcousticRiemannSolver::UHllc, an HLLC
                                approximate Riemann solver (new code)
  fluid_dynamics_inner.hpp    - HLLC integration in BaseIntegration1stHalf::interaction
                                for fluid-fluid pairs
  fluid_dynamics_complex.hpp  - HLLC integration for fluid-wall pairs

These files are provided as complete modified sources rather than patches, so
that they can be diffed against the corresponding late-2023 upstream revision.
They are NOT a contribution to SPHinXsys and were never submitted upstream.

cases/square_droplet_high_re.cpp is the stock SPHinXsys example
  tests/2d_examples/test_2d_square_droplet/src/droplet.cpp with two density
  constants changed. Same copyright and licence as above.

